{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（28日）一集高潮迭起，丁麗明（江美儀飾）帶領孝君（吳卓羲飾），在香港調查官家秘密資金去向的同時，孝賢（張智霖飾）在澳門亦為重啟夢幻之城計劃、包括如何幫信義（蔡一智飾）打甩販毒罪向各方施壓，其間惹來反噬，亦令被逼埋牆的Alice（高海寧飾）及Sarah更團結！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:13.921667+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:56:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:58:11.409108+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:13.921667+00:00","content_hash":"4b41c4dcae73496313fc76c13a47595a7368ff7702b427773c0d83dea72cbebd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}